    "body": "### What this fixes\n\n`_get_stage_from_forward_mode()` (profile V2) maps `prefill`/`decode`/`idle` to a profile stage and falls through to:\n\n```\nraise RuntimeError(f\"unsupported profile stage: {forward_mode=}\")\n```\n\nfor any other mode. `ForwardMode.PREBUILT` is the disaggregated-decode placeholder for requests whose KV just arrived; it never enters a model forward. With `SGLANG_PROFILE_V2=1`, a scheduled prebuilt batch therefore crashes the profiling step instead of being ignored.\n\nThe V1 path already handles this — `SchedulerProfilerManager._profile_batch_predicate` ignores `IDLE` and `PREBUILT` (merged in #40098). This applies the same handling to the V2 path.\n\n### Fix\n\nTreat `is_prebuilt()` like `is_idle()` and return `None` (no stage).\n\n### Test\n\nAdded `test/registered/unit/utils/test_profile_utils.py`, a CPU-only unit test covering prefill/decode/idle/prebuilt mapping.\n\n### Duplicate check\n\n#40098 fixed only the V1 predicate in `profiler_manager.py`; it did not touch `profile_utils.py`, so the V2 path is still affected. No open PR addresses the V2 mapping.\n\n### AI assistance\n\nAI assistance was used; the change is a two-line guard plus a CPU unit test.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #35470394222](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35470394222)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35470394062](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35470394062)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #35470394215](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35470394215)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
